---
import { profile } from '../../data/profile'
const updated = '31 October 2026'
---

<div class="content" data-app-content="terms">
  <h1>Terms of use</h1>
  <p class="meta">Last updated {updated}</p>

  <h2>About this site</h2>
  <p style="margin-top:6px">
    This site describes my professional background and work. It is provided as it is, for information. I keep it
    accurate, but it may not reflect every change straight away.
  </p>

  <h2>Content</h2>
  <p>
    Text and design on this site are © {new Date().getFullYear()} {profile.name}. You are welcome to link to any page
    and to share my resume with people considering me for a role.
  </p>

  <h2>Code</h2>
  <p>
    The source code is public on <a href="https://github.com/Anush-Prabhu/anushprabhu.com">GitHub</a>. Its reuse is
    governed by the license in that repository; where none is given, all rights are reserved.
  </p>

  <h2>The terminal</h2>
  <p>
    The terminal on this site is a simulation. It only understands a fixed set of commands about my work and cannot run
    anything on this server or on your device.
  </p>

  <h2>Other sites</h2>
  <p>Links to other sites are for convenience. I'm not responsible for their content.</p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>These terms may change; the date above shows the latest version.</p>
</div>
